10,0,2,talk,Midori,,"I appreciate the enthusiasm, everyone. Let’s keep the conversation friendly and focused on finding the truth.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""name_label"",""name"":""Midori"",""self"":true,""raw"":""Midori: I appreciate the enthusiasm, everyone. Let’s keep the conversation friendly and focused on finding the truth.""}]}"
